;(Talk to Seele)
:'''Seele:''' Ready for action? It's time to kick the IPC out of the Underworld.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Let's go.
::'''Seele:''' Let's get moving!
:<pre>{
	"$type": "RPG.GameCore.OpenTreasureChallenge",
	"RaidID": 43101,
	"OnCancel": []
}</pre>
:{{Диалог|Выход}} Not just yet.
